.TH sane\-oki 5 "10 Feb 2026" "@PACKAGEVERSION@" "SANE Scanner Access Now Easy"
.IX sane\-oki
.SH NAME
sane\-oki \- SANE backend for OKI MFP scanners
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B sane\-oki
library implements a SANE (Scanner Access Now Easy) backend that provides
access to OKI multifunction printer (MFP) scanners.
.PP
The following scanner families are supported:
.PP
.RS
MB series (MB441, MB451, MB461, MB471, MB472, MB491, MB492, MB562)
.br
MC series (MC332, MC342, MC351, MC352, MC361, MC362, MC561, MC562, MC563, MC573, MC851, MC852, MC853, MC860, MC861, MC862, MC863, MC873, MC883)
.br
ES series (ES3451, ES3452, ES3461, ES4161, ES4172LP, ES4191, ES4192, ES5162, ES5162LP, ES5461, ES5462, ES5463, ES5473, ES8451, ES8453, ES8460, ES8461, ES8462, ES8463, ES8473, ES8483)
.br
CX/MPS series (CX2633, CX2731, MPS2731mc, MPS4200mb, MPS4700mb)
.RE
.SH CONFIGURATION
The contents of the
.I oki.conf
file is a list of USB device lines of the form:
.PP
.RS
.B usb
.I vendor_id product_id
.RE
.PP
Empty lines and lines starting with a hash mark (#) are ignored.
See
.BR sane\-usb (5)
for details.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I @CONFIGDIR@/oki.conf
The backend configuration file.
.TP
.I @LIBDIR@/libsane\-oki.a
The static library implementing this backend.
.TP
.I @LIBDIR@/libsane\-oki.so
The shared library implementing this backend (present on systems that
support dynamic loading).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SANE_DEBUG_OKI
If the library was compiled with debug support enabled, this
environment variable controls the debug level for this backend. Higher
debug levels increase the verbosity of the output.

Example:
.br
SANE_DEBUG_OKI=4 scanimage \-L
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR sane (7),
.BR sane\-usb (5),
.BR sane\-find\-scanner (1),
.BR scanimage (1)
.SH AUTHOR
SANE Developers
